      "instructions": "Include municipal elderly-care employers and clearly identified municipal contractors. Distinguish new hires from existing staff and municipality-wide rules from one unit. General expectations of good Swedish are not necessarily a formal tested threshold. A language-test pilot does not make an already established requirement a pilot. Code implementation of the underlying requirement separately from testing methods. A decision made in 2024 with implementation in 2025 is not a pre-2025 requirement. A dated account explicitly saying a rule already applies can establish that it was in force by that date, even if the exact introduction date is unknown. Leave effective_date null in that case. Never infer introduction from publication alone.",
